### 4. MCP server entry point
**`bin/claudepoint.js`** is the dual-mode entry point. It auto-detects how it is being invoked:
- **CLI mode**: When stdin/stdout are TTY or CLI arguments are present (e.g., `claudepoint --help`)
- **MCP server mode**: When stdin is piped (no TTY) -- i.e., when Claude Code launches it as an MCP server

In MCP mode, it dynamically imports `src/mcp-server.js`, which uses the `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` (v0.5.0) with a `StdioServerTransport` (stdin/stdout communication).

